_database_PDB_caveat.id     1 
_database_PDB_caveat.text   
;Residues LYS A 838 and SER A 839 are linked together in the model; however, there are residues between them in the deposited polymeric sequence.  Residues TYR B 167 and PHE B 169 are linked together in the model; however, there are residues between them in the deposited polymeric sequence.  Residues LYS C 838 and SER C 839 are linked together in the model; however, there are residues between them in the deposited polymeric sequence.
;
